\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 .  Awake, my soul, and with the sun
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Thy daily stage of duty run;
\par Shake off dull sloth, and joyful rise,
\par To pay thy morning sacrifice
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy precious time misspent redeem;
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Each present day thy last esteem
\par Improve thy talent with due care;
\par For the great day thyself prepare.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  In conversation be sincere;
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj  Keep conscience as the noon tide clear
\par Think how all-seeing God thy ways
\par And all thy secret thoughts surveys
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Wake, and lift up thyself, my heart;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 And with the angels bear thy part;
\par Who all night long unwearied sing;
\par High praise to the eternal King
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  I wake, I wake, ye heavenly choir!
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 May your devotion me inspire
\par That I, like you, my age may spend
\par \pard      Like you, may on my God attend
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f1\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl202\slmult0\qj 6.  Praise God, from whom all blessings flow;
\par \pard\li315\sl202\slmult0 Praise Him, all creatures here below; 
\par Praise Him above, ye heavenly host;
\par Praise Father, Son and Holy Ghost.\cf1\ul\b 
\par \pard 
\par \f2\fs16 
\par }

